async function press(id){const translation={normal:"经典版",jobs:"职业版",customized:"自定义版",offline:"多人版"};let res;await dialog(translation[id],`即将开始 Bank Robber ${translation[id]}`,"开始")&&(window.location.href=`${id}.html`)}document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded",()=>{$("#normal").addEventListener("click",()=>press("normal")),$("#jobs").addEventListener("click",()=>press("jobs")),$("#customized").addEventListener("click",()=>press("customized")),$("#offline").addEventListener("click",()=>press("offline"))});